WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:03.650
Your last lesson ends at six.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.670
Your admin doesn't.

3
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.930
Eleven at night: "Can we move Thursday?"

4
00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.880
Ten at night: "I'll transfer it tonight."

5
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.950
Eight in the morning: "So
sorry, can't make it today."

6
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.100
That's an empty slot,
and forty pounds gone.

7
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.800
One late cancel a week costs you two
thousand and eighty pounds a year.

8
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.210
Then add your evenings on texts,
your Sundays on the books,

9
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.960
and money you've earned
still sitting with learners.

10
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.820
And it's getting heavier.

11
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.120
The typical wait for a car
test is now eleven weeks,

12
00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:40.950
so every learner stays with you longer,
with more gaps and more messages.

13
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:45.170
Teaching all day. Admin all night.

14
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.235
It doesn't have to work like this.

15
00:00:48.255 --> 00:00:51.770
Doovor's founder, Talha, passed his
test in January twenty twenty-five,

16
00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:55.510
after almost two weeks
just finding an instructor.

17
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.910
Every lesson ran on calls,
WhatsApp and bank transfers,

18
00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.730
and his instructor had the
same mess from the other side.

19
00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.500
So he built one app to sort it all.

20
00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:09.280
Meet Doovor: your diary, bookings,
payments and lesson records,

21
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.510
in one app. And it's free to start.

22
00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:17.060
Your whole day is on one screen: every
lesson, where to pick each learner up,

23
00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.670
and who has paid.

24
00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:20.370
Send learners your booking link.

25
00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:24.550
They pick from the times you're
free, at your prices, in a free app.

26
00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:27.870
Nothing is ever booked twice,
time is kept free between lessons,

27
00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:30.800
and weekly lessons book themselves.

28
00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:34.780
They pay before the lesson, by
card, Apple Pay or Google Pay,

29
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.850
straight into your own account.

30
00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:39.080
Sell packages of hours, paid up front.

31
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.590
On Pro, their saved card
is charged the day before.

32
00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.140
Cash or a bank transfer?

33
00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.880
Two taps, and it's recorded.

34
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.130
Doovor never holds your money.

35
00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.990
Your cancellation policy
is shown before they book,

36
00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.140
and Doovor applies it for
you, late fees included.

37
00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.240
No awkward conversation.

38
00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:00.450
Reminders go out the day before and
two hours before, so they turn up.

39
00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:03.960
After the lesson, tap the skills
you covered and rate each one.

40
00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.360
Under a minute, even with no signal.

41
00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:09.220
Your learner sees it straight
away, with a map of their progress,

42
00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.260
so they know what to practise.

43
00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:15.960
Your money's always counted: this
week, this month, this tax year,

44
00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:17.300
and what's still owed.

45
00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:21.640
And when Making Tax Digital reaches
you, Pro keeps your receipts and miles,

46
00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:25.030
and exports it all by
tax year and quarter.

47
00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:30.130
Setting up takes about twenty minutes:
your badge, your prices and your hours.

48
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.450
Bring your learners from a spreadsheet,
or invite them by WhatsApp,

49
00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.110
text or email. Switch on payments,

50
00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.420
and your link takes bookings
once your badge is checked.

51
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.380
Already use another app?

52
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.650
Run both side by side for a fortnight.

53
00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.500
If Doovor isn't better,
stay where you are.

54
00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.040
Learners who won't use an app?

55
00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.560
Book for them yourself.

56
00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:54.340
Not great with tech? Talha will set it up
with you, in person anywhere in Bexley,

57
00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.550
Greenwich or Dartford, or on a free call.

58
00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.670
He does the typing.

59
00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.830
So here's the deal.

60
00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:05.300
Doovor is free to start: no
card, about twenty minutes,

61
00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.440
and booking and card payments
are on the Free plan.

62
00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.680
Doovor takes nothing from your lessons.

63
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:14.220
The first hundred instructors
get Pro free for a year.

64
00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.500
After them, it's ninety days free.

65
00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:20.320
And after your year, you choose:
Pro at twelve pounds a month,

66
00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.940
or stay free for up to ten learners.

67
00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:26.510
Nothing is ever charged
unless you choose Pro.

68
00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:28.810
Starting costs you nothing.

69
00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.800
Not starting could cost you
two thousand pounds a year,

70
00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.890
and every evening and
Sunday that goes with it.

71
00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:39.520
Tap "Claim your founding place", just
below, and get your green light today!
